===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|nl|vlag}}. Influenced by {{ncog|en|flag}} (as by spelling with ⟨ф⟩ instead of ⟨в⟩) so as not to clash with {{m|ru|влах|t=Vlach}}. The programming sense is a {{sl|ru|en|flag|nocap=1}}.

